:0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nAffected 4.8 dev 6, 7 (and probably earlier)\nDoes not happen in 4.7.2\n\n### System information\n\nopenSUSE Tumbleweed 20261003 on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors (2560x1600 @ 165.00 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz) - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 8060S Graphics (RADV STRIX_HALO) - AMD RYZEN AI MAX+ 392 w/ Radeon 8060S (24 threads) - 61.94 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen you hover a symbol and then quickly move cursor outside the script editor, the tooltip for the symbol will still appear at the cursor outside the editor.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c200aa49-8eca-4ff8-9996-19778b75ddaa\n\nSeems to happen when cursor moves outside the editor without leaving the symbol. Notice how the line as at the very top with no space between it and the editor's edge.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Have a script with any symbol that has a tooltip\n2. Scroll the script view so that the aforementioned symbol appears in the top line\n3. Hover the symbol then move the cursor outside the editor through the top\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.g